<title>SWEDEN: Sweden approves Swedbank, Foreningsbanken merger.</title>
<headline>Sweden approves Swedbank, Foreningsbanken merger.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish competition authority said on Tuesday it approved the merger of banks Swedbank and Foreningsbanken into ForeningsSparbanken.</p>
</text>
